{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55068","headline":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 二十六 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 《周易》占候第二十六（三十七首） 二十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官临火，尅我应（辛本、川本作「虑」）偷营。\n水立官乡休立寨，土临官鬼四方兵，不可（辛本、川本作「一」）乱提兵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}